&lt;h2 id="あらすじ"&gt;あらすじ&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unwittingly I found myself in a room without doors or windows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;My only companion was a mischievous older girl. As for me, I was naked.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;She grinned with a vixen sensuality and uncrossed her legs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;Sperm,&amp;rdquo; she said, &amp;ldquo;If you sperm on me, you cannot leave.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;
